; Every component a cost spec repeats is reported, in source order, and the
; transaction is kept with the first of each kind.
2020-01-01 open Assets:I
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "buy"
  Assets:I  1 HOOL {100.50 USD, (1+2) USD, "a", "b", 2020-01-01, 2021-01-01, # 2 USD, EUR}
  Assets:C

2020-01-03 * "currency first"
  Assets:I  1 HOOL {USD, 10 USD}
  Assets:C  -10 USD

2020-01-03 * "total braces"
  Assets:I  2 HOOL {{100 USD, 300 USD}}
  Assets:C

2020-01-04 balance Assets:I 4 HOOL
2020-01-04 balance Assets:C -210.50 USD
